%% TRIP-002 Admin sign-in
flowchart TD
    Open["Visitor opens /admin"] --> Proxy{proxy.ts:<br/>valid cookie?<br/>R4, R5}
    Proxy -- no --> Login["/admin/login<br/>R1"]
    Proxy -- yes --> Admin[Admin page]
    Login --> Enter[Enters password]
    Enter --> Check{Right password?}
    Check -- no --> Wrong[Fel lösenord.<br/>R2]
    Wrong --> Enter
    Check -- yes --> Cookie[Signed session cookie,<br/>valid 8 hours<br/>R3, R4]
    Cookie --> Admin
    Admin --> Change[Changes data] --> Action{Server action:<br/>still signed in?<br/>R7}
    Action -- no --> NotSigned[Du är inte inloggad längre.]
    Action -- yes --> Saved[Change saved]
    Admin --> Logout[Logga ut<br/>R6] --> Login
